; Five cards a segment in (pc, kind, n, and the CINH and CTOT cards of row pc of the phoneme table), one out: c, how many of the segment's frames are its closure. All of a
; pause's; all but the last of a stop's (the last is the burst); of an affricate's, (n CINH + CTOT / 2) / CTOT, at
; least 1 and at most n - 1, with CINH (the closure's inherent ms) and CTOT (closure and frication's); none of
; anything else. The division is n steps of adding CINH and taking away CTOT.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   pc       03-29: a segment: a pause, a stop
  04                    INP   kind
  05                    INP   n
  06                    INP   cinh
  07                    INP   ctot
  08                    CLA   z
  09                    STO   c
  10                    CLA   kind
  11                    SUB   c8
  12                    TAC   nap
  13                    CLA   n
  14                    STO   c
  15                    JMP   out
  16            nap     CLA   kind
  17                    SUB   n4
  18                    TAC   out
  19                    SUB   00
  20                    TAC   stop
  21                    SUB   00
  22                    TAC   out
  23                    SUB   00
  24                    TAC   ask
  25                    JMP   out
  26            stop    CLA   n
  27                    SUB   00
  28                    STO   c
  29                    JMP   out
  30            ask     CLA   ctot    30-80: an affricate
  31                    ADD   ctot
  32                    ADD   ctot
  33                    ADD   ctot
  34                    ADD   ctot
  35                    SFT   01
  36                    STO   rem
  37                    CLA   n
  38                    STO   i
  39            lp      CLA   i
  40                    SUB   00
  41                    TAC   clamp
  42                    STO   i
  43                    CLA   rem
  44                    ADD   cinh
  45                    STO   rem
  46            wl      CLA   rem
  47                    SUB   ctot
  48                    TAC   lp
  49                    STO   rem
  50                    CLA   c
  51                    ADD   00
  52                    STO   c
  53                    JMP   wl
  54            clamp   CLA   c
  55                    SUB   00
  56                    TAC   c1
  57                    JMP   cmax
  58            c1      CLA   00
  59                    STO   c
  60            cmax    CLA   n
  61                    SUB   00
  62                    SUB   c
  63                    TAC   cn
  64                    JMP   out
  65            cn      CLA   n
  66                    SUB   00
  67                    STO   c
  68            out     OUT   c
  69                    JMP   rec
  70            pc      DATA  0
  71            kind    DATA  0
  72            n       DATA  0
  73            c       DATA  0
  74            cinh    DATA  0
  75            ctot    DATA  0
  76            rem     DATA  0
  77            i       DATA  0
  78            z       DATA  0
  79            c8      DATA  8
  80            n4      DATA  4
